l,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103841","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-28T00:27:05Z"},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11948\r\n\r\nThis add shortcuts for the `suspend/pause` and `next frame` buttons inside the embed window.\r\n\r\nI've set the following default hotkeys\r\n- F9 to toggle suspend/pause\r\n- F10 to advance to next frame\r\n\r\nThey are the same hotkeys as `Breakpoint` and `Step into` hotkeys. But they don't conflict with each other due to different context focus.\r\n\r\nThe F9 hotkey is using the same convention as the breakpoint hotkey uses for macos.\r\nSo the hotkey is: `KeyModifierMask::META | KeyModifierMask::SHIFT | Key::B`\r\n\r\nI've **intentionally** let the next frame button work with is_echo() so you can hold the button to skip several frames.\r\n\r\nThis adds a very systematic way to add new shortcuts for the embed window buttons if any more buttons would like to have hotkeys. More info on the steps are inside the issue.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73452966-b5b2-4ee6-886d-6e386d4829eb\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Re